WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:12,340
Still thank you, Mr. Enchen Ring

2
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:13,340
This edict

3
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:18,910
Can you send it back to His Majesty?

4
00:00:18,910 --> 00:00:22,640
I asked casually

5
00:00:22,640 --> 00:00:28,130
Thank you for your hard work, father-in-law, for making this trip

6
00:00:28,130 --> 00:00:29,130
Mr. Fang, don’t worry

7
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:32,130
You have left your name in front of His Majesty.

8
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:34,130
And His Majesty personally arranged a position for you

9
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:36,160
Apparently I remember you.

10
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:38,160
His Majesty arranged it himself

11
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:40,160
Mr. Fang, feel free to do it this time

12
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:42,160
let you become a dentist

13
00:00:42,160 --> 00:00:43,160
It is said to be the law of responsibility

14
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:45,190
It's actually grace

15
00:00:45,190 --> 00:00:52,470
That's the young master

16
00:00:52,470 --> 00:00:54,470
Just listen to it these days

17
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:56,470
Master is not here

18
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:57,470
Something happened

19
00:00:57,470 --> 00:01:02,380
We can't help you either

20
00:01:02,380 --> 00:01:09,490
What can Master Zhang Long do without help?

21
00:01:09,490 --> 00:01:11,490
The job at Shuntianfu Dentist

22
00:01:11,490 --> 00:01:14,650
Can you find a bodyguard to help me for a few days?
